<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Customer auto-assign rules · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>
body{margin:0;padding:20px;background:#fff4e8;color:#251044;font:16px system-ui}main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto}a{color:#411575}button,input,select{font:inherit;padding:12px;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:12px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}button{background:#411575;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.5}input[type=search]{width:100%;background:white}input[type=checkbox]{width:22px;height:22px}label{display:block;margin:12px 0}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.card{padding:16px;background:white;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:16px;margin:12px 0}.card p{color:#655474;line-height:1.6}.row strong{flex:1}dialog{box-sizing:border-box;width:min(720px,94vw);max-height:90dvh;overflow:auto;border:0;border-radius:18px;background:#fff4e8;color:#251044}dialog::backdrop{background:#25104499}.day{display:grid;grid-template-columns:125px 1fr 85px;gap:10px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5d8ec}.day input[type=number]{width:85px}.day select{width:100%}.day label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.notice{white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:650}.secondary{background:#eee5fa;color:#411575}@media(max-width:500px){.day{grid-template-columns:1fr 85px}.day>label{grid-column:1/-1;margin-bottom:0}}
[hidden]{display:none!important}.view-controls button{background:#eee5fa;color:#411575}.view-controls button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#411575;color:white}.rule-overview-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,330px),1fr));gap:14px;align-items:start}.overview-section{background:white;border:1px solid #dfd2eb;border-radius:16px;padding:14px;margin:14px 0}.overview-section>summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:750;padding:6px 0}.route-plan{margin:0}.route-plan>summary strong,.route-plan>summary span{display:block}.route-plan>summary span{font-size:13px;color:#655474;font-weight:500;margin:6px 0}.overview-stop{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid #eee6f5;padding:10px 0;font-size:14px}.overview-stop>span{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.overview-stop button{font-size:12px;padding:8px;flex:none;min-height:38px}.overview-rank{font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;background:#eee5fa;color:#411575;border-radius:9px;padding:8px}.overview-stop small{display:block;margin-top:4px}.overview-warning{background:#fff2cc;color:#713f00;border-radius:8px;padding:10px}.overview-count{font-weight:700}.unruled-section>p{font-size:13px;color:#655474}.overview-filters label{margin:0}.overview-filters select{display:block;margin:5px 0}main{max-width:1600px}.view-controls{margin:14px 0}
.rule-map-dialog{width:min(96vw,1200px);max-width:96vw;max-height:94dvh}.rule-map-canvas{height:48dvh;min-height:280px;margin:12px 0;background:#eee5fa}.rule-map-choices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;max-height:110px;overflow:auto}.rule-map-choices label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;margin:0}.rule-map-dialog .row label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.rule-map-dialog [role=status]{font-size:13px}.rule-map-dialog.large-map{width:96vw;max-width:96vw}.large-map .rule-map-canvas{height:65dvh}.rule-map-dialog .map-stop-editor{font:14px system-ui;max-width:290px;color:#251044}.map-stop-editor strong{display:block}.map-stop-editor label,.map-stop-editor select{display:block;width:100%;margin:8px 0}.map-stop-editor button{width:100%}.map-stop-editor [role=status]{font-size:12px}
</style></head><body><main><nav><a href="/warehouse-planning">← Route planning</a> · <a href="/workspaces?workspace=management">Management</a></nav><h1>Customer auto-assign rules</h1><p>Choose each customer's delivery weekdays, saved route and preferred stop order. Changes apply when you click Auto assign; existing stops stay as arranged.</p><p id="message" class="notice" role="status"></p><div class="row"><button id="refresh">Refresh rules</button><label id="only-label"><input id="only" type="checkbox"> Only customers with rules</label></div><div class="row view-controls" aria-label="Rule display"><button id="customer-view" aria-pressed="true">Customer list</button><button id="overview-view" aria-pressed="false">Route overview</button></div><label>Find customer or delivery location<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Customer / location name"></label><section id="customer-list-view"><p id="count"></p><div id="customers"></div><div class="row"><button id="previous">Previous</button><span id="page"></span><button id="next">Next</button></div></section><section id="route-overview-view" hidden><p>Saved auto-assign plans, including occasional customers without a current invoice. Stop numbers are preferred positions; gaps are kept so occasional orders fit in the right order. Editing a rule keeps existing daily routes unchanged.</p><div class="row overview-filters"><label>Weekday<select id="overview-day"><option value="">All weekdays</option><option value="1">Monday</option><option value="2">Tuesday</option><option value="3">Wednesday</option><option value="4">Thursday</option><option value="5">Friday</option><option value="6">Saturday</option><option value="0">Sunday</option></select></label><label>Route<select id="overview-route"><option value="">All routes</option></select></label><button id="overview-collapse" class="secondary">Collapse routes</button><button id="overview-expand" class="secondary">Expand routes</button></div><div id="overview-results"></div></section></main><dialog id="editor"><h2 id="title"></h2><form id="form"><div id="days"></div><p id="error" class="notice" role="alert"></p><div class="row"><button id="save" type="submit">Save weekday rules</button><button id="remove" class="secondary" type="button">Remove rule</button><button id="cancel" class="secondary" type="button">Cancel</button></div></form></dialog><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/route-rules.js"></script><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/office-notification.js"></script></body></html>
